<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls to 6.11 pct on 3-m Italy T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls to 6.11 pct on 3-m Italy T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 27.00 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.11	(6.52)    98.50	  (98.40)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.37	(6.32)    96.92	  (96.93)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.40	(6.55)    94.00	  (93.85)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on May 12.</p>
</text>
